{"v":2,"voice":"ziggy-v3","locale":"fr","story":"d03","segments":{"title":{"file":"title.mp3","dur":2.91,"text":"Le lapin et le vase de la lune","words":[0.12,0.425,0.925,1.025,1.2,1.5,1.625,1.85],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.275,"grin"],[0.525,"open"],[0.625,"small"],[0.7,"smile"],[0.775,"grin"],[1.225,"small"],[1.275,"smile"],[1.35,"open"],[1.425,"grin"],[1.725,"open"],[1.875,"grin"],[1.95,"smile"],[2.05,"o"],[2.2,"grin"],[2.435,"smile"]]},"s1":{"file":"s1.mp3","dur":23.65,"text":"Au bord d’un pré, dans un terrier tout rond, vivait Pompon, un petit lapin gris aux grandes oreilles. Il portait toujours une salopette bleue. Sur la cheminée de sa grand-mère trônait un trésor : le vase de la lune. Il était bleu pâle, avec une lune d’argent peinte dessus. Le soir, il brillait doucement.","words":[0.12,0.42,0.77,1.045,1.57,1.82,1.995,2.495,2.745,3.345,3.72,4.62,4.795,5.17,5.645,5.945,6.045,6.445,7.67,7.935,8.41,8.96,9.135,9.785,10.75,11.055,11.305,11.83,11.98,12.18,12.855,13.33,13.455,14.505,14.505,14.73,15.03,15.13,15.305,16.32,16.57,16.795,17.12,18.02,18.295,18.47,18.72,19.22,19.52,20.83,21.21,21.76,21.985,22.36],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.27,"o"],[0.445,"small"],[0.52,"smile"],[0.62,"o"],[0.695,"grin"],[0.87,"o"],[1.07,"small"],[1.195,"smile"],[1.27,"grin"],[1.47,"smile"],[1.595,"grin"],[1.645,"open"],[1.77,"grin"],[1.845,"o"],[2.02,"grin"],[2.595,"o"],[2.82,"smile"],[2.895,"o"],[2.97,"smile"],[3.37,"small"],[3.445,"grin"],[3.545,"small"],[3.62,"grin"],[3.745,"small"],[3.82,"o"],[3.92,"smile"],[4.045,"small"],[4.12,"smile"],[4.195,"o"],[4.27,"smile"],[4.645,"o"],[4.82,"small"],[4.895,"grin"],[5.27,"open"],[5.37,"small"],[5.495,"grin"],[5.795,"smile"],[5.87,"grin"],[5.97,"o"],[6.07,"grin"],[6.22,"open"],[6.32,"grin"],[6.47,"o"],[6.57,"grin"],[6.645,"smile"],[6.77,"grin"],[7.155,"smile"],[7.76,"grin"],[8.01,"o"],[8.085,"grin"],[8.51,"o"],[8.635,"grin"],[8.71,"smile"],[8.785,"o"],[8.86,"grin"],[8.985,"o"],[9.035,"grin"],[9.235,"open"],[9.31,"grin"],[9.385,"o"],[9.485,"sm